        <div class="uc-section">
            <div class="uc-section-title"><span>{{cfg.title}}</span></div>
            <div class="table-responsive">
            <table class="table table-hover uc-api-key-list">
                <thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>密钥前缀</th><th>状态</th><th>IP 白名单</th><th>到期时间</th><th>最近使用</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
{{#keys}}
                    <tr data-api-key-id="{{id}}">
                        <td><strong>{{name}}</strong></td>
                        <td><code>{{prefix}}…</code></td>
                        <td>{{#expired}}<span class="uc-badge uc-badge-danger">已过期</span>{{/expired}}{{^expired}}{{#enabled}}<span class="uc-badge uc-badge-ok">已启用</span>{{/enabled}}{{^enabled}}<span class="uc-badge uc-badge-muted">已停用</span>{{/enabled}}{{/expired}}</td>
                        <td>{{#allow_ip}}{{allow_ip}}{{/allow_ip}}{{^allow_ip}}<span class="uc-dim">不限制</span>{{/allow_ip}}</td>
                        <td>{{#expiretime}}{{expiretime}}{{/expiretime}}{{^expiretime}}<span class="uc-dim">永久</span>{{/expiretime}}</td>
                        <td>{{#lasttime}}{{lasttime}}<br><span class="uc-dim">{{lastip}}</span>{{/lasttime}}{{^lasttime}}<span class="uc-dim">尚未使用</span>{{/lasttime}}</td>
                        <td><div class="uc-acts"><button type="button" class="uc-act" data-api-key-toggle title="{{#enabled}}停用{{/enabled}}{{^enabled}}启用{{/enabled}}"><i class="fa fa-{{#enabled}}pause{{/enabled}}{{^enabled}}play{{/enabled}}" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><button type="button" class="uc-act uc-act-danger" data-api-key-delete title="删除"><i class="fa fa-trash" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div></td>
                    </tr>
{{/keys}}
{{^keys}}<tr><td colspan="7" class="uc-empty">{{cfg.empty}}</td></tr>{{/keys}}                </tbody>
            </table>
            </div>
            <p class="uc-tip">外部程序调用上传接口时，在请求头中发送 <code>Authorization: Bearer 你的密钥</code>，并通过名为 <code>file</code> 的表单字段提交文件。上传会使用当前账号的文件大小和每日数量额度。</p>
        </div>
